I worked with a team of programmers on the maintenance of a legacy
sales management application, designing and coding modules in the
CodeIgniter framework.

The website was also built using Wordpress.

![Screenshot](screenshot.png)

System maintenance, equipment repair, network configuration.

Reverse engineering was done on a sales system built in Visual
Basic 6 and PostgreSQL, to determine its data model and create PHP
extensions.

![Wine](wine.png)

## Technologies

- Wordpress
- CodeIgniter
- PHP
- MySQL
- Visual Basic 6
- PostgreSQL
- Ubuntu
